  "It may be damaged, or written by software Chinotto doesn't understand. You can rebuild it: the songs on the iPod are added back from their files (playlists, play counts and ratings may be lost), and the old database is kept in a backup folder on the iPod.": "",
  "It will be automatically resized such that its shortest side measures 600px. The change applies once the image is saved to your device.": "",
  "It'll be removed from the iPod and from all its playlists, and the music file deleted from the iPod. Your own copies elsewhere aren't touched.": "",
  "It'll be taken out of this library and its playlists, and won't come back at the next scan. The music file stays where it is: nothing is deleted.": "",
  "It's saved into the song files when you press OK; images larger than 600 px on the shorter side are shrunk to that.": "",
